# VITE_API_BASE_URL must be EMPTY for the Vercel + Render deployment.
# When empty, all /api/* and /uploads/* requests use relative paths,
# which Vercel rewrites (vercel.json) forward to the Render backend.
# Same-origin cookies work in all browsers — no cross-origin/third-party
# cookie issues (Safari, Firefox ETP, Chrome third-party cookie changes).
#
# If you set this to https://tishbitedigital1.onrender.com in the Vercel
# dashboard, the browser makes direct cross-origin requests to Render,
# which breaks cookie-based auth in many browsers.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
